-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 3, §3.4 תקופת ניסיון וקביעות
-- Probation and tenure of elementary-school teachers: what a year of work
-- is, how long probation lasts, the supervisors' visits and evaluations, the
-- yearly timetable of opinions and recommendations, extensions and their
-- limits, who decides, and the warnings to uncertified teachers.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `3.4 תקופת ניסיון וקביעות`

DECLARE `probation action` IS ONE OF
    `visit the teacher`
    `arrange a visit by someone versed in the subject`
    `send the principal's opinion forms`
    `return the completed forms`
    `pass the forms and the treatment sheet to the general supervisor`
    `submit the recommendation with the principal's opinion`
    `send an extension notice`
    `send a warning letter`
    `send copies of the warning letters to the personnel division`
    `send a copy of the notice to the owner`
    `extend probation a second time` HAS `union consented beforehand` IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `recommendation` IS ONE OF
    `grant tenure`
    `extend probation`
    `sub-supervision and dismissal for pedagogical reasons`
    `administrative dismissal`

DECLARE `stage of an uncertified teacher` IS ONE OF `stage A`, `stage A+`, `other stage`

@desc A teaching employee on probation, as far as section 3.4 asks about it.
DECLARE `probationer` HAS
    `certified when hired`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `year of work in which certified`       IS A NUMBER  @desc 0 if not certified during probation
    `a kindergarten teacher hired for general or professional teaching` IS A BOOLEAN
    `uncertified stage`                     IS A `stage of an uncertified teacher`
    `extension notices received`            IS A NUMBER

§§ `1 A year of work`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_1__subpara_a
GIVEN `days actually worked in official institutions` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a year of work` `days actually worked in official institutions` IF
    `days actually worked in official institutions` AT LEAST 150

-- 1ב: work outside official education does not count towards probation,
-- even where it counted towards professional seniority.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_1__subpara_b
GIVEN `in official education` IS A BOOLEAN, `counted for professional seniority` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `counts towards probation` `in official education` `counted for professional seniority` IF
    `in official education`

§§ `2-6 How long probation lasts`

-- 2: a certified teacher: 2 years of work at a third of a position at least
-- (printed "3 / 1"), unless an extension notice was sent on the
-- supervision's reasoned opinion; never proposed for tenure after one year.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_2
`least position fraction for a year of probation` MEANS 1/3

GIVEN `years of probation done` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be proposed for tenure` `years of probation done` IF
    `years of probation done` GREATER THAN 1

-- 3: an uncertified teacher: 4 years at a third of a position at least.
-- 4: one certified during probation: 3 years if certified in her second
-- year, 4 if in her third or fourth. F-3.4-a: one certified during her
-- FIRST year is not covered; she is read as certified (2 years).
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_3
GIVEN p IS A `probationer`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years of probation` p IS
    IF p's `a kindergarten teacher hired for general or professional teaching`
    THEN 4
    ELSE IF p's `certified when hired`
         THEN 2
         ELSE `years by the year of certification` (p's `year of work in which certified`)

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_4
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `years by the year of certification` y IS
    BRANCH
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_4__subpara_a
        IF y EQUALS 2 THEN 3
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_4__subpara_b
        IF y EQUALS 3 OR y EQUALS 4 THEN 4
        IF y EQUALS 1 THEN 2
        OTHERWISE 4

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `years 3.4.4 prints for certification in year` y IS
    IF y EQUALS 2 THEN LIST 3
    ELSE IF y EQUALS 3 OR y EQUALS 4 THEN LIST 4
         ELSE EMPTY

`certification in the first year has no row in 3.4.4` MEANS
    `years 3.4.4 prints for certification in year` 1 EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `certification in the first year has no row in 3.4.4`

-- 5: a certified kindergarten teacher hired at the outset for general or
-- professional teaching counts as uncertified (4 years), in `years of
-- probation` above.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_5
GIVEN p IS A `probationer`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a kindergarten teacher counted as uncertified` p IF
    p's `a kindergarten teacher hired for general or professional teaching`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_6
GIVEN `tenured professional teacher or kindergarten teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `moving to general teaching` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `starts a new probation` `tenured professional teacher or kindergarten teacher` `moving to general teaching` IF
    NOT (`tenured professional teacher or kindergarten teacher` AND `moving to general teaching`)

§§ `7-8 Visits and evaluations`

-- 7: every supervisor visits every teacher under him at least once a year
-- (time in school months); in probation, in a subject he is not versed in,
-- he arranges a visit by someone suitable.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_7
GIVEN `on probation in a subject the supervisor is not versed in` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.7 the yearly visit` `on probation in a subject the supervisor is not versed in` IS
    IF `on probation in a subject the supervisor is not versed in`
    THEN PARTY `the supervisor`
         MUST  `arrange a visit by someone versed in the subject`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `the supervisor` BECAUSE "3.4.7: a suitable person visits in a subject the supervisor is not versed in"
    ELSE PARTY `the supervisor`
         MUST  `visit the teacher`
         WITHIN 12
         LEST  BREACH BY `the supervisor` BECAUSE "3.4.7: every supervisor visits every teacher at least once a year"

-- 8: where two supervisors evaluate a teacher differently in one period, a
-- committee of three decides: the district manager and two supervisors
-- (state-religious: the district supervisor, the district's supervisor of
-- religious education and a state-religious supervisor).
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_8
DECLARE `committee seat` IS ONE OF
    `the district manager`
    `a supervisor`
    `the district's supervisor of religious education`
    `a state-religious supervisor`

GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A LIST OF `committee seat`
DECIDE `the committee of three` `state-religious` IS
    IF `state-religious`
    THEN LIST `the district manager`, `the district's supervisor of religious education`, `a state-religious supervisor`
    ELSE LIST `the district manager`, `a supervisor`, `a supervisor`

-- 8 ¶2: between a current and an earlier evaluation, after a break or on a
-- continuous move between districts, the latest prevails; "new in the
-- district" alone does not justify recommending an extension.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_8/p2
GIVEN `the latest evaluation` IS A NUMBER, `an earlier evaluation` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the evaluation that holds` `the latest evaluation` `an earlier evaluation` IS
    `the latest evaluation`

GIVEN `new in the district` IS A BOOLEAN, `other grounds` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `grounds to recommend an extension` `new in the district` `other grounds` IF
    `other grounds`

§§ `9-13 The yearly timetable and the decision`

-- Times are days from 1 September of the school year: 1 January is day 122,
-- 1 February 153, 1 March 181, 15 April 226, 30 June 302.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_9
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.9 forms to the principals by 1 January` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    MUST  `send the principal's opinion forms`
    WITHIN 122
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.9: the district office sends the principal's opinion forms by 1 January"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_9/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.9 the forms back by 1 February` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MUST  `return the completed forms`
    WITHIN 153
    LEST  BREACH BY `the school principal` BECAUSE "3.4.9: the principal returns the completed forms by 1 February"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_9/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.9 to the general supervisor by 1 March` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    MUST  `pass the forms and the treatment sheet to the general supervisor`
    WITHIN 181
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.9: the district office passes the forms on by 1 March"

-- 9 ¶4 and 10: the general supervisor states his position on the
-- principal's evaluation, and closes his treatment sheet with an explicit,
-- reasoned recommendation — one of א-ד, ד for uncertified teachers only;
-- for a professional teacher the professional supervisor's opinion is
-- attached; by 15 April to the district supervisor, with the principal's
-- opinion.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_9/p4 akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10
GIVEN r IS A `recommendation`, `the teacher is certified` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a recommendation open to the supervisor` r `the teacher is certified` IF
    CONSIDER r
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_a
    WHEN `grant tenure` THEN TRUE
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_b
    WHEN `extend probation` THEN TRUE
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_c
    WHEN `sub-supervision and dismissal for pedagogical reasons` THEN TRUE
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_d
    WHEN `administrative dismissal` THEN NOT `the teacher is certified`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_d/p2
GIVEN `a professional teacher` IS A BOOLEAN, `professional supervisor's opinion attached` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the report is complete` `a professional teacher` `professional supervisor's opinion attached` IF
    (NOT `a professional teacher`) OR `professional supervisor's opinion attached`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_d/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.10 the recommendation by 15 April` IS
    PARTY `the supervisor`
    MUST  `submit the recommendation with the principal's opinion`
    WITHIN 226
    LEST  BREACH BY `the supervisor` BECAUSE "3.4.10: the general supervisor's recommendation reaches the district supervisor by 15 April"

-- ¶4-¶5: where a supervisor's recommendation does not follow from his own
-- evaluation, the district manager decides — in state-religious education
-- after consulting the district's supervisor of religious education.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_d/p4 akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_10__subpara_d/p5
GIVEN `recommendation follows from the evaluation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the district manager must decide the mismatch` `recommendation follows from the evaluation` IF
    NOT `recommendation follows from the evaluation`

-- 11: no extension of a certified teacher's probation without the
-- supervision's well-reasoned opinion, the dates of the visits and the
-- average of their evaluations.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_11
DECLARE `extension file` HAS
    `well-reasoned opinion`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `dates of the visits`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `average of the evaluations` IS A BOOLEAN

GIVEN f IS AN `extension file`, `certified` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the extension may be made` f `certified` IF
        (NOT `certified`)
    OR  (f's `well-reasoned opinion` AND f's `dates of the visits` AND f's `average of the evaluations`)

-- 12: a second extension needs the Teachers' Union's prior consent, sought
-- through the district office only on exceptional grounds.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_12
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.12 no second extension without the union` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    SHANT `extend probation a second time` consented PROVIDED NOT consented
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.12: a second extension needs the Teachers' Union's prior consent"

-- 13: the district manager decides extension or tenure; in state-religious
-- education after consulting its district supervisor, and if he does not
-- accept that supervisor's view the matter goes to the head office.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_13 akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_13/p2
DECLARE `who decides` IS ONE OF `the district manager decides`, `the head office decides`

GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN, `accepts the religious supervisor's view` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `who decides`
DECIDE `who decides tenure` `state-religious` `accepts the religious supervisor's view` IS
    IF `state-religious` AND NOT `accepts the religious supervisor's view`
    THEN `the head office decides`
    ELSE `the district manager decides`

§§ `14-20 Kindergarten teachers, the uncertified, warnings`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_14
`least minutes of a supervisor's visit to a kindergarten` MEANS 120

-- 15: within 3, an uncertified teacher at stage A or A+ gets no tenure in her
-- fourth year of probation; the district manager sends her notice of a
-- further year, for administrative reasons.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_15
GIVEN p IS A `probationer`, `year of probation` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a further year for administrative reasons` p `year of probation` IF
        NOT p's `certified when hired`
    AND p's `year of work in which certified` EQUALS 0
    AND NOT p's `uncertified stage` EQUALS `other stage`
    AND `year of probation` EQUALS 4

-- 16א: the district office sends the notices of 15, first checking (1) that
-- the teacher was not certified after the Passover exam and (2) her address.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_16__subpara_a akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_16__subpara_a/p2
GIVEN `checked no certification after the Passover exam` IS A BOOLEAN, `checked the private address` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the notice may be sent` `checked no certification after the Passover exam` `checked the private address` IF
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_16__subpara_a__cls_1
        `checked no certification after the Passover exam`
    @ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_16__subpara_a__cls_2
    AND `checked the private address`

-- 16ב: a teacher found certified meanwhile: the district manager weighs
-- tenure or a further year for pedagogical reasons, giving his reasons.
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_16__subpara_b
DECLARE `outcome for one certified meanwhile` IS ONE OF `tenure`, `a further year for pedagogical reasons, with reasons`

GIVEN `the district manager's choice` IS AN `outcome for one certified meanwhile`
GIVETH AN `outcome for one certified meanwhile`
DECIDE `one certified meanwhile` `the district manager's choice` IS `the district manager's choice`

-- 17-19: the district managers send warning letters in a set form to every
-- uncertified teacher in her third year of probation (graduates of every
-- kind of training institution included), copies to the personnel division
-- at the end (state-religious: via the head of religious education); the
-- last day for extension notices and warnings is 30 June (day 302).
@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_17
GIVEN `uncertified` IS A BOOLEAN, `year of probation` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.17 warning letters` `uncertified` `year of probation` IS
    IF `uncertified` AND `year of probation` EQUALS 3
    THEN PARTY `the district manager`
         MUST  `send a warning letter`
         WITHIN `the last day for notices and warnings`
         HENCE (PARTY `the district manager`
                MUST  `send copies of the warning letters to the personnel division`
                LEST  BREACH BY `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.18: copies of the warnings go to the personnel division")
         LEST  BREACH BY `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.17/19: the warning is sent by 30 June"
    ELSE FULFILLED

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_18
DECLARE `route of the copies` IS ONE OF `straight to the personnel division`, `via the head of religious education`

GIVEN `state-religious` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `route of the copies`
DECIDE `how the copies go` `state-religious` IS
    IF `state-religious` THEN `via the head of religious education` ELSE `straight to the personnel division`

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_19
`the last day for notices and warnings` MEANS 302

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.19 extension notices by 30 June` IS
    PARTY `the district manager`
    MUST  `send an extension notice`
    WITHIN `the last day for notices and warnings`
    LEST  BREACH BY `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.19: extension notices are sent by 30 June"

@ref akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_2__para_20
GIVEN `a non-official teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `probation action`
DECIDE `3.4.20 a copy to the owner` `a non-official teacher` IS
    IF `a non-official teacher`
    THEN PARTY `the district manager`
         MUST  `send a copy of the notice to the owner`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the district manager` BECAUSE "3.4.20: a copy of the notice goes to the owner of a non-official teacher's institution"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_3 The heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_3/p1 A source: circular of the institutions division no. 26 of 22.12.72; director-general's circular לב/7.
-- akn:chp_3__sec_3_4__hc_3/p2 A source: circular of the institutions division no. 37, section 82.

-- Worked examples.
`certified in her second year` MEANS
    `probationer` WITH
        `certified when hired`                  IS FALSE
        `year of work in which certified`       IS 2
        `a kindergarten teacher hired for general or professional teaching` IS FALSE
        `uncertified stage`                     IS `other stage`
        `extension notices received`            IS 0
#ASSERT `years of probation` `certified in her second year` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT NOT `may be proposed for tenure` 1
#ASSERT `a year of work` 150
#ASSERT NOT `a recommendation open to the supervisor` `administrative dismissal` TRUE

#TRACE `3.4.9 forms to the principals by 1 January` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the district manager` DOES `send the principal's opinion forms` AT 115
#TRACE `3.4.10 the recommendation by 15 April` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the supervisor` DOES `submit the recommendation with the principal's opinion` AT 240
#TRACE `3.4.17 warning letters` TRUE 3 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the district manager` DOES `send a warning letter` AT 290
    PARTY `the district manager` DOES `send copies of the warning letters to the personnel division` AT 295
#TRACE `3.4.12 no second extension without the union` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the district manager` DOES `extend probation a second time` FALSE AT 100
